ition", "style": "glitch", "color": [0.04, 0.08, 0.18], "start": 18.7, "end": 19.4}, {"type": "blob", "x": 1380, "y": 520, "r": 580, "color": [0.15, 0.45, 0.95], "color2": [0.65, 0.25, 0.9], "fill_opacity": 0.36, "softness": 0.9, "start": 19.0, "end": 25.0}, {"type": "text", "text": "THE UNSEEN FORCE", "font": "medium_italic", "size": 38, "x": 480, "y": 280, "color": [0.35, 0.85, 1.0], "start": 19.2, "end": 25.0, "fixed": true, "in": {"anim": "slide_down", "dur": 0.5}}, {"type": "text", "text": "SHAPING", "font": "bold_italic", "size": 110, "x": 480, "y": 410, "color": [1, 1, 1], "start": 19.5, "end": 25.0, "fixed": true, "in": {"anim": "slide_up", "dur": 0.5}}, {"type": "text", "text": "REALITY", "font": "bold_italic", "size": 110, "x": 480, "y": 530, "start": 19.8, "end": 25.0, "fixed": true, "gradient": {"from": [0.35, 0.85, 1.0], "to": [0.95, 0.4, 0.75]}, "in": {"anim": "slide_up", "dur": 0.5}}, {"type": "line", "points": [[200, 600], [760, 600]], "width": 4, "color": [0.35, 0.85, 1.0], "start": 20.2, "end": 25.0, "in": {"anim": "wipe_right", "dur": 0.6}}, {"type": "text", "text": "Silently transforming human existence", "font": "medium_italic", "size": 36, "x": 480, "y": 660, "color": [0.8, 0.88, 1.0], "start": 20.5, "end": 25.0, "fixed": true, "in": {"anim": "fade", "dur": 0.5}}, {"type": "device", "kind": "laptop", "path": "assets/sample_screenshot.png", "w": 960, "x": 1360, "y": 590, "start": 19.6, "end": 25.0, "float": {"y": 10, "speed": 0.7}, "in": {"anim": "rise", "dur": 0.8}}, {"type": "chip", "emoji": "\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f", "label": "The Transformation Begins", "x": 480, "y": 780, "scale": 1.1, "rot": -2, "start": 21.0, "end": 25.0, "in": {"anim": "pop", "dur": 0.5}}]}}, {"title": "Beyond the Supercomputer", "brief": "Visuals transition from massive laboratory servers to sleek consumer microchips. The audience learns that Artificial Intelligence has broken out of research labs and is no longer just computer software. Building on the hook, it introduces AI as an omnipresent infrastructure woven into the fabric of society.", "seconds": 25.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "AI in Your Palm", "brief": "The camera zooms into daily smartphone usage, highlighting biometric unlocks, predictive text, and computational photography. Viewers discover that pocket devices are running billions of neural calculations every hour. This moves the narrative from abstract computing concepts directly into the user's hands.", "seconds": 30.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "Wheels with a Mind", "brief": "Dynamic tracking shots show autonomous vehicles navigating complex urban traffic with sensor overlays and LIDAR maps. The viewer learns how computer vision and machine learning are revolutionizing transport and road safety. This extends the smartphone AI concept into physical machines moving through space.", "seconds": 30.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "Healing Through Algorithms", "brief": "The scene shifts to modern clinical environments showing robotic surgery arms and AI-assisted radiological scans. Viewers see how AI predicts diseases earlier and customizes patient treatment with superhuman precision. This takes mobility and engineering into the critical realm of saving human lives.", "seconds": 35.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "The Digital Colleague", "brief": "We explore modern corporate offices and digital studios where automated systems analyze data and generative tools assist creative tasks. The narrative explains how work culture is shifting from manual execution to strategic co-creation with algorithms. This transitions personal technology into professional and economic survival.", "seconds": 35.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "The Invisible Household", "brief": "Visuals capture smart homes adjusting ambient lighting, energy consumption, and appliance routines without manual input. Viewers understand ambient computing, where AI fades into the background of domestic daily life. This shifts the focus from external workplaces back into intimate living spaces.", "seconds": 30.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "The Ethical Crossroads", "brief": "Moody, dramatic visuals depict surveillance screens, data privacy graphics, and automation anxiety. The audience confronts the critical risks of algorithmic bias, job displacement, and data harvesting. This acts as a necessary counterweight to the technological marvels showcased in previous chapters.", "seconds": 30.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "The Next Horizon", "brief": "Futuristic CGI depicts quantum processors, neural interfaces, and the dawn of artificial general intelligence (AGI). Viewers discover experimental technologies expected to redefine the next ten years of civilization. This pivots from present-day challenges to the exponential trajectory of tomorrow.", "seconds": 30.0, "spec": null}, {"title": "Coexisting with Intelligence", "brief": "Warming cinematic imagery shows humans and intelligent machines collaborating harmoniously across diverse cultures. The video concludes with a reflective call to action on guiding AI with human values, ethics, and purpose. This provides a resonant, inspiring resolution to the journey started in the opening scene.", "seconds": 30.0, "spec": null}], "done": false, "created": 1794061760, "key": "3feace44445e", "updated": 1794062640}